  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "公民社會的政策參與",
    "sub_ename": "POLICY PARTICIPATION OF CIVIL SOCIETY",
    "describe_ch": "結合包括政治學、政策科學和憲政運作實務等領域的統合性學科。本項課程具有三個目的（一）讓學習者了解公眾問題如何進入政策議題，然後成為政府政策，政府執行政策需考慮那些重要的因素。（二）身為現代公民，應如何藉由社會行動及民主程序參與政策制訂,以便解決公眾關心的問題。（三）了解一個負責任的政府如何提高政策績效，以獲得人民的信任和支持。本課程是一門應用的社會科學，它運用政策相關理論以及民主運作程序的多元方法，產出並轉化公共問題成為公共政策，因此本課程特別強調政策案例研究和公共議題的討論。",
    "describe_eh": "Introduction to public policy is an interdisciplinary course that involving politics, policy science and the experiences in constitutional operation, etc. There are three purpose of this course:\r\n1.\tTo understand how the public problems become policy issues then into governmental policy and how much elements need to consider during policy be implemented.\r\n2.\tAs a citizen, how to participate in policy making by using social action and democratic process for solving problems which people concerned.\r\n3.\tTo understand that a responsible government how to increase policy effects to have trust from people when policies implement needs to think about.\r\nThis course is an applied social science discipline which uses multiple methods of policy-relevant theory and democratic process to produce and transform public problems into public policy which means cases study and public issues discussing will be emphasized in this course.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "幫助學生瞭解政策案例,思考週邊公共問題,以及解決公共問題的政策方法和過程,提昇問題解決的思辨能力.",
      "describe_en": "Assist students to understand policies, to think about public issues of communities and policies, methods and processes for solving public problems to improve the capacity of policy discussion."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "輔導學生組成公民團體,建立討論平臺.運用系統思考;繪製心智圖..等方法,增進學生對於公共問題及參與政策的興趣.",
      "describe_en": "Guide students to build citizen groups, to establish discussion platforms, to plan activities, to use systematic thinking and mind mapping, mandal-art method etc. to discuss topics of class learning."
    }
  ],
